            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Schwerpunkt is a World War 2 military simulation game. Fight through several scenarios, making daring manoeuvres in an attempt to outsmart your enemy.  You will take control of a plethora of unique units, each of which will play a role in securing success. Use armoured units to smash through enemy lines while motorised infantry fills the gaps.<br><br><strong>Environments</strong><br>Your quest for victory will take you through a multitude of environments, from vast plains to boggy marshes. The terrain will affect the performance of your units, so plan your offensives accordingly.<br><br><strong>Units</strong><br>You control many unique units, each of which come in a variety of sizes. Units have strengths and weaknesses. For example, it would be unwise to send armour against an enemy anti-tank division.<br><br><strong>Map Editor</strong><br>If you complete all the scenarios or have an idea for a map, you can use the map editor to create new scenarios. Enjoy limitless access to all the terrain settings and unit types available.",
            "about_the_game": "Schwerpunkt is a World War 2 military simulation game. Fight through several scenarios, making daring manoeuvres in an attempt to outsmart your enemy.  You will take control of a plethora of unique units, each of which will play a role in securing success. Use armoured units to smash through enemy lines while motorised infantry fills the gaps.<br><br><strong>Environments</strong><br>Your quest for victory will take you through a multitude of environments, from vast plains to boggy marshes. The terrain will affect the performance of your units, so plan your offensives accordingly.<br><br><strong>Units</strong><br>You control many unique units, each of which come in a variety of sizes. Units have strengths and weaknesses. For example, it would be unwise to send armour against an enemy anti-tank division.<br><br><strong>Map Editor</strong><br>If you complete all the scenarios or have an idea for a map, you can use the map editor to create new scenarios. Enjoy limitless access to all the terrain settings and unit types available.",
            "short_description": "Schwerpunkt is a World War 2 military simulation game. Take control of hundreds of units over a large frontline, making daring manoeuvres to push your enemy back. Fight in one of the scenarios given or make your own in the map maker.",
